{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38544","headline":"僧舍白牡丹二首 二 · 吴融","name":"僧舍白牡丹二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侯家万朵簇霞丹，若并霜林素艳难。\n合影只应天际月，分香多是畹中兰。\n虽饶百卉争先发，还在三春向後残。\n想得惠林凭此槛，肯将荣落意来看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}